{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-25","kind":"proposition","title":"立方数的比例结构","englishTitle":"If two numbers have to one another the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number, and the first be cube, the second will also be cube.","book":8,"number":25,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":25,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","contentId":"euclid-8-25","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2fd28256aca119f2b286f8a8231323cd5e159a5065c71db0abb3431c1814ebf9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-25.statement","euclid-8-25.construction.1","euclid-8-25.proof.1","euclid-8-25.proof.2","euclid-8-25.proof.3","euclid-8-25.construction.2","euclid-8-25.conclusion","euclid-8-25.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-25.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"393486d7320fa5bdab2396db42064bf69efdcd86e92e0f0c4a39e2b883f274ef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers have to one another the ratio which a cube number has to a cube number, and the first be cube, the second will also be cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字相对,立方数和立方数的比例,第一个是立方体,第二个也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10b2a26f2b53cb289d9a3f98bf7ad4e45e5850deec0e7fd3cc6b62df2b07220c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B have to one another the ratio which the cube number C has to the cube number D, and let A be cube; I say that B is also cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B数字必须相互对应 立方数,C数字与立方数,D数字的比,A数字也相提并论;我说B数字也是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45c32880c8627197f27f2e5b1947676af35119f92c84287e4135d86d56ea74d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since C, D are cube, C, D are similar solid numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,C,D是立方体,C,D是相似立体数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab809f67b22c98a900192f0a04edfa757009e0f06e9aa3e3d9683f24dac90784","citations":["euclid-8-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two mean proportional numbers fall between C, D. [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,2 比例中项个数字在C到D之间。 [[VIII. 19](/principles/euclid-8-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f882b9f5442b13120110d3da7d482bc7d41ec9dd508a8c32837213a6c29e2a3c","citations":["euclid-8-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many numbers as fall between C, D in continued proportion, so many will also fall between those which have the same ratio with them; [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)] so that two mean proportional numbers fall between A, B also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"和连比例的C到D之间, 如此多的数字也会在 和它们相同的比例之间下降, 因此,两个比例中项的数字也下降了A,B。 [[VIII. 8](/principles/euclid-8-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2f719893f2cd6a36b70932ff90fcd1b6323c862b1bc2416b0a06de1ec1cfbb9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let E, F so fall."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E,F,这样下去。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c709f899eca60d9915a2285da024b74b27a050b2879421b5c19746ce88a7cbb","citations":["euclid-8-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the four numbers A, E, F, B are in continued proportion, and A is cube, therefore B is also cube. [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,4个号码A,E,F,B是连比例,A是立方体,因此B也是Q。 E,D。 [[VIII. 23](/principles/euclid-8-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-25.source","contentId":"euclid-8-25","revisionId":"euclid-8-25@raw-2fd28256aca119f2","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de66a0317093f6390ec05f601d3e1fa0137c229955b0339668aa9ea77e9f19e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-25:euclid-8-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-25.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 19"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-25:euclid-8-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-25.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-25:euclid-8-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-25.conclusion"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.25/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 23"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-10:euclid-8-25:explic